政"],"content":"6望氣爲數者多言有土功象；九月，甲申，莽起九廟於長安城南，黃帝廟方四十丈，高十七丈，餘廟半之，制度甚盛。博徵天下工匠及吏民以義入錢穀助作者，駱驛道路；窮極百工之巧；功費數百餘萬，卒徒死者萬數。","content_fanyi":"以望气、术数进行占测的人大多说出现了动土兴建的征兆。九月甲申日，王莽在长安城南兴建九庙，黄帝庙四十丈见方，高十七丈，其余各庙规模减半，制度十分宏伟。朝廷广泛征召天下工匠，以及自愿按道义捐助钱粮的官吏百姓，应征的工匠和捐助的钱粮在道路上往来不绝；极尽各种工匠的巧妙技艺；工程耗费数百万钱，服役的卒徒死去的数以万计。","content_jianti_auto":"6望气为数者多言有土功象；九月，甲申，莽起九庙于长安城南，黄帝庙方四十丈，高十七丈，余庙半之，制度甚盛。博征天下工匠及吏民以义入钱谷助作者，骆驿道路；穷极百工之巧；功费数百余万，卒徒死者万数。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2910,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9343265e-db0e-11ef-bf07-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"7是月，大雨六十餘日。","content_fanyi":"这个月，大雨下了六十多天。","content_jianti_auto":"7是月，大雨六十余日。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2911,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"93432666-db0e-11ef-b390-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93432669-db0e-11ef-89ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"馬適","people_name_jianti_auto":"马适","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9343266a-db0e-11ef-9527-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"求","people_name_jianti_auto":"求","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"9343266b-db0e-11ef-9bcf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：馬適，姓也。求，名也。","note_content_jia