cs":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"9莽以私鑄錢死及非沮寶貨投四裔，犯法者多，不可勝行；乃更輕其法，私鑄作泉布者與妻子沒入爲官奴婢，吏及比伍知而不舉告，與同罪；非沮寶貨，民罰作一歲，吏免官。","content_fanyi":"王莽起初规定，私自铸钱者处死，非议、阻挠宝货者流放到四方边远地区；结果犯法的人太多，难以全部执行，于是减轻刑罚：私自铸造泉布的人，连同妻子儿女没入官府充当奴婢；官吏和同伍邻里知情而不检举告发的，与犯者同罪；非议、阻挠宝货的，平民罚服劳役一年，官吏免去官职。","content_jianti_auto":"9莽以私铸钱死及非沮宝货投四裔，犯法者多，不可胜行；乃更轻其法，私铸作泉布者与妻子没入为官奴婢，吏及比伍知而不举告，与同罪；非沮宝货，民罚作一岁，吏免官。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2913,"number":9,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"93432675-db0e-11ef-82ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9343267d-db0e-11ef-bd00-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"尊","people_name_jianti_auto":"尊","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"9343267e-db0e-11ef-8736-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢氏","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉氏","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"9343267f-db0e-11ef-afbf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：柴車，卽棧車。藉稾，去蒲蒻也。褏，古袖字。余按漢氏之盛，乘牸牝者禁不得會聚，至鄕閭阡陌皆然。朝市之間，從可知矣。尊爲上公而乘牝，亦以矯世也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：柴车，即栈车。藉稾，去蒲蒻也。褏，古袖字。余按汉氏之盛，乘牸牝者禁不得会聚，至鄕闾阡陌皆然。朝市之间，从可知矣。尊为上公而乘牝，亦以矫世也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"9343267c-db0e-11ef-8495-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93432682-db0e-11ef-9b18-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：赭幡，以赭汁漬巾幡。汚，烏故翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：赭幡，以赭汁渍巾幡。汚，乌故翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"93432681-db0e-11ef-922e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93432685-db0e-11ef-9af6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"尊","people_name_jianti_auto":"尊","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"93432686-db0e-11ef-9130-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔子","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"93432687-db0e-11ef-96ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"莽","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"93432688-db0e-11ef-9c6e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：令與尊同此操行也。論語稱孔子曰：見賢思齊，故莽云然。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：令与尊同此操行也。论语称孔子曰：见贤思齐，故莽云然。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"93432684-db0e-11ef-90a2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"太傅","official_note":"太傅是古代三公之一，负责辅佐皇帝，此处平晏死后由唐尊接任，显示王莽政权的人事变动。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"太傅平晏死；以予虞唐尊爲太傅。","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8a17a64e-65f7-4160-a101-12aaf858c14a"},{"confidence":0.7,"official_category":"未知","official_name":"予虞","official_note":"予虞可能是官职名，但具体职能不明，在上下文中唐尊由此职升任太傅。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以予虞唐尊爲太傅。","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"018c169d-f774-48a6-ba8f-692b789e9492"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"公卿","official_note":"公卿泛指高级官员，此处唐尊赠送礼物给公卿，显示其行为影响高层。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"又以歷遺公卿。","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"5bd735e3-023b-4ad0-b096-3f0b144ee372"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"爵位","official_name":"平化侯","official_note":"平化侯是封爵，此处王莽封唐尊为侯，以示奖赏其行为。","official_rank":"侯爵","source_snippet":"封尊爲平化侯。","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"28a0219a-9d4e-422d-b7ba-0b6e765bd140"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":20,"link_td_description":"平晏，西汉、新朝大臣，梁国下邑，後爲平陵人，父為平当。","link_td_id":"Q10012780","link_td_number_id":1505525,"people_name":"平晏","people_name_jianti_auto":"平晏","people_xingming":"平晏","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9343268a-db0e-11ef-bb30-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"唐尊","people_name_jianti_auto":"唐尊","people_xingming":"唐尊","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"9343268b-db0e-11ef-b55b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"尊","people_name_jianti_auto":"尊","people_xingming":"唐尊","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"9343268c-db0e-11ef-82ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"尊","people_name_jianti_auto":"尊","people_xingming":"唐尊","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"9343268d-db0e-11ef-ac65-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-45,"link_death_year":23,"link_td_description":"王莽，字巨君，魏郡元城貴鄉（今河北邯郸大名縣東）人，篡夺汉朝自立，不被承认的僭主，是西漢末年政治人物、外戚及權臣。他最終以「假皇帝」（代理皇帝）身份登基並建立新朝，自称“皇帝”。稱帝後的王莽大舉推行向周朝看齊的復古改革，引發社會動盪，再加上黃河改道等天災，以致各地豪強紛起，亦有民變发生，新朝僅14年就被推翻，王莽也被叛軍所殺。文獻記載王莽身高七尺五寸（大約173公分）。他終其一生都自奉甚儉、治家嚴苛，曾先後命三名行為不端的嫡子自盡。","link_td_id":"Q10008016","link_td_number_id":16053,"people_name":"莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"莽","people_xingming":"王莽","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"9343268e-db0e-11ef-baa9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"尊","people_name_jianti_auto":"尊","people_xingming":"唐尊","start_index":108,"tongjian_id":"9343268f-db0e-11ef-95a6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"平化侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"平化侯","people_xingming":"唐尊","start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"93432690-db0e-11ef-a2d2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9343267b-db0e-11ef-9261-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"xiù","source_anchor_text":"身短衣小褏乘牝馬柴","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":37,"text":"褏","tongjian_id":"1123d56d-fcd9-52a6-9986-b4c21f20bf2b"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"9343267b-db0e-11ef-9261-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zhě","source_anchor_text":"車以象刑赭幡污染其","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":80,"text":"赭","tongjian_id":"cbb1318e-190d-5d93-9d0e-32ebffeacb56"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"10太傅平晏死；以予虞唐尊爲太傅。尊曰：「國虛民貧，咎在奢泰。」乃身短衣小褏，乘牝馬、柴車，藉稾，以瓦器飲食，又以歷遺公卿。出，見男女不異路者，尊自下車，以象刑赭幡汚染其衣。莽聞而說之，下詔申敕公卿：「思與厥齊；」封尊爲平化侯。","content_fanyi":"太傅平晏去世；任命予虞唐尊为太傅。唐尊说：“国家空虚，百姓贫困，过错在于奢侈过度。”于是他身穿短衣窄袖，乘坐母马拉的简陋柴车，垫着草垫坐卧，用瓦器进食饮水，又依次把这些瓦器赠给公卿。外出时，见到男女走路不分开的，唐尊便亲自下车，用象刑所用的、浸过赭红色染料的布幡弄脏他们的衣服。王莽听说后，很赞赏这种做法，下诏告诫公卿：“要想着与他看齐。”封唐尊为平化侯。","content_jianti_auto":"10太傅平晏死；以予虞唐尊为太傅。尊曰：「国虚民贫，咎在奢泰。」乃身短衣小褏，乘牝马、柴车，藉稾，以瓦器饮食，又以历遗公卿。出，见男女不异路者，尊自下车，以象刑赭幡汚染其衣。莽闻而说之，下诏申敕公卿：「思与厥齐；」封尊为平化侯。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2914,"number":10,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9343267b-db0e-11ef-9261-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"司法","official_name":"詔獄","official_note":"詔獄是皇帝直接下令設立的監獄，用於關押政治犯或重大案件犯人，此處指王莽將郅惲關入詔獄以示懲罰。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"繫惲詔獄","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"dc166043-a6ef-4c77-bc22-d92a872de08a"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"郅恽，字君章，汝南郡西平县（今河南省舞阳县东南）人，东汉经学家。","link_td_id":"Q10007488","link_td_number_id":6183799,"people_name":"郅惲","people_name_jianti_auto":"郅恽","people_xingming":"郅恽","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"93432693-db0e-11ef-ab94-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-45,"link_death_year":23,"link_td_description":"王莽，字巨君，魏郡元城貴鄉（今河北邯郸大名縣東）人，篡夺汉朝自立，不被承认的僭主，是西漢末年政治人物、外戚及權臣。他最終以「假皇帝」（代理皇帝）身份登基並建立新朝，自称“皇帝”。稱帝後的王莽大舉推行向周朝看齊的復古改革，引發社會動盪，再加上黃河改道等天災，以致各地豪強紛起，亦有民變发生，新朝僅14年就被推翻，王莽也被叛軍所殺。文獻記載王莽身高七尺五寸（大約173公分）。他終其一生都自奉甚儉、治家嚴苛，曾先後命三名行為不端的嫡子自盡。","link_td_id":"Q10008016","link_td_number_id":16053,"people_name":"莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"莽","people_xingming":"王莽","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"93432694-db0e-11ef-90d2-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-45,"link_death_year":23,"link_td_description":"王莽，字巨君，魏郡元城貴鄉（今河北邯郸大名縣東）人，篡夺汉朝自立，不被承认的僭主，是西漢末年政治人物、外戚及權臣。他最終以「假皇帝」（代理皇帝）身份登基並建立新朝，自称“皇帝”。稱帝後的王莽大舉推行向周朝看齊的復古改革，引發社會動盪，再加上黃河改道等天災，以致各地豪強紛起，亦有民變发生，新朝僅14年就被推翻，王莽也被叛軍所殺。文獻記載王莽身高七尺五寸（大約173公分）。他終其一生都自奉甚儉、治家嚴苛，曾先後命三名行為不端的嫡子自盡。","link_td_id":"Q10008016","link_td_number_id":16053,"people_name":"莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"莽","people_xingming":"王莽","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"93432697-db0e-11ef-941d-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"郅恽，字君章，汝南郡西平县（今河南省舞阳县东南）人，东汉经学家。","link_td_id":"Q10007488","link_td_number_id":6183799,"people_name":"惲","people_name_jianti_auto":"恽","people_xingming":"郅恽","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"93432698-db0e-11ef-b45f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"汝南","place_name_jianti_auto":"汝南","resolved_place_entity_id":179,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"93432695-db0e-11ef-ac74-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","resolved_place_entity_id":9,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"93432696-db0e-11ef-ac39-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","权争"],"content":"11汝南郅惲明天文曆數，以爲漢必再受命，上書說莽曰：「上天垂戒，欲悟陛下，令就臣位。取之以天，還之以天，可謂知命矣！」莽大怒，繫惲詔獄，踰冬，會赦得出。","content_fanyi":"汝南人郅恽通晓天文历数，认为汉朝必定会再次承受天命，于是上书劝说王莽说：“上天显示警戒，是想让陛下醒悟，使您回到臣子的位分上。从上天那里取得天下，就应当把它归还给上天，这才称得上懂得天命啊！”王莽大怒，把郅恽关入诏狱，过了一个冬天，遇上大赦才得以出狱。","content_jianti_auto":"11汝南郅恽明天文历数，以为汉必再受命，上书说莽曰：「上天垂戒，欲悟陛下，令就臣位。取之以天，还之以天，可谓知命矣！」莽大怒，系恽诏狱，逾冬，会赦得出。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，可不谓怪乎？以莽之惨，无不可杀者，而恽免于死；莽诬天而...","context_before":"天下相习于怪，无不怪也。","source_end_index":34,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8a674088-d973-4756-9324-daa17f1188f5","source_start_index":12,"source_text":"郅恽引天文历数，上书王莽，令就臣位，复立汉室"}],"title":"四 天下相习于怪，无不怪也"}],"id":2915,"number":11,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"93432691-db0e-11ef-a06c-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"地皇元年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"地皇元年","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9340c691-db0e-11ef-89f8-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（庚辰、二○）","year_int":20},"message":"success","success":true}